title: "createTeam (stem-system teams.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: checkAdmin()
    q_auth --> q_parse: parsedData = teamSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_auth --> q_error: checkAdmin throws
    q_parse --> q_invalid: parsedData.success == false
    q_parse --> q_insert: parsedData.success == true
    q_invalid --> [*]: return error "Invalid data", team null
    q_insert --> q_db_insert: supabaseAdmin.from("teams").insert(name, discord_role_id).select().single()
    q_db_insert --> q_db_error: insert error
    q_db_insert --> q_revalidate: insert success, newTeam returned
    q_db_error --> q_error: throw error
    q_revalidate --> [*]: revalidatePath, return team
    q_error --> [*]: return error message, team null

    note right of q_auth
        INV-001: Admin check is always performed before any DB mutation
        INV-002: Input is validated via Zod schema before insert
        INV-003: Admin client (not user client) is used for the insert operation
    end note
